---
layout: base.njk
title: About the PTSA
permalink: /about/
---
<img class="hero" src="/assets/img/hero-banner.png"
     alt="Saguaro Creek PTSA — K-8 School in the Vail School District in Arizona. Home of the Sidewinders!">

<section class="section">
  <h1>About the Saguaro Creek PTSA</h1>
  <p>
    We're the Parent Teacher Student Association for {{ site.school }} in the
    Vail School District, Arizona — a 501(c)(3) nonprofit run entirely by
    volunteers. Our mission: {{ site.mission }}
  </p>
  <p class="callout">“{{ site.motto }}”</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Our first year, by the numbers</h2>
  <p>
    From our very first year, the Saguaro Creek K–8 PTSA has transformed the
    support of our families, volunteers, and community partners into meaningful
    opportunities for students and staff.
  </p>
  <ul class="feature-list">
    <li><strong>{{ site.firstYearMembers }}</strong> PTSA members</li>
    <li><strong>{{ site.firstYearFundraisers }}</strong> successful fundraisers</li>
    <li><strong>{{ site.firstYearRaised }}</strong> raised</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Looking ahead to {{ site.schoolYear }}</h2>
  <p>
    As we look ahead to the {{ site.schoolYear }} school year, the Saguaro
    Creek K–8 PTSA is excited to build on the momentum of our first year. By
    creating more student-centered events, welcoming greater family and
    volunteer involvement, and continuing to support meaningful school
    experiences, we hope to make every Sidewinder's journey even more
    memorable.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Executive officers · {{ site.schoolYear }}</h2>
  {% set officers = fetched.officers | preferItems(manual.officers) %}
  <table class="officer-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Email Address</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for o in officers %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ o.name }}</td>
        <td>{{ o.title }}</td>
        <td>{% if o.email %}<a href="mailto:{{ o.email }}">{{ o.email }}</a>{% else %}—{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>How we run</h2>
  <p>
    We meet during the school year — every family is welcome, and members vote.
    Meeting agendas and minutes are public:
    <a href="/minutes/">read them here</a>. Membership and all payments are
    handled securely on <a href="{{ site.givebacks }}">Givebacks</a>; this site
    never touches money.
  </p>
  <div class="button-row">
    <a class="btn" href="{{ site.store }}">Join the PTSA — {{ site.membershipPrice }}/year</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/minutes/">Agendas &amp; minutes</a>
  </div>
</section>
